        <item>
            <title>0.8.43</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:43:40 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>136</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.43</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.43

- A dictation is no longer lost when saving it to Transcripts fails: the text is pasted first.
- If the microphone reconnects mid-recording, the words from before the reconnect are kept.
- A stuck transcription now stops with a message and keeps the recording. The menu bar says Transcribing instead of Warming up.
- Two quick dictations in a row put back your own clipboard, not the first dictation.
- One bad setting no longer resets the rest, and your Replace rules are kept.
- Copy last transcript works when saving transcripts is off.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.43/Say-Halo-0.8.43-build-136.zip" length="16184885" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="0ilvozMB+6sT/FSXxYx4Qq6ZpBveBR/rwfSP2FRQrvY6JZTyo9QZDnpAIGxcjoQvLC7So9+ia9WKaiXcK4KUAQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.8.42</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:19:15 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>135</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.42</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.42

- Settings: the version and Check for Updates row is easier to read, and the changelog moved to the bottom beside Acknowledgements.
- The volume slider shows only when Sounds is on.
- Recommended options are labelled, and new installs start with them on.
- Transcripts: the date buttons match the rest of the app.
- Replace: the formatting switches sit beside the test box, so your rules start higher on the page.
- Onboarding: the health check rows are numbered.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.42/Say-Halo-0.8.42-build-135.zip" length="16086235" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="dHzMqdfQ4ZfWO10djs2+QaSIDUoLd5FQDN4k1qghpejR25oksa/De5TryVzwMscm3f0ap7ku77ZpVDUEGsBRAg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.8.41</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:48:42 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>134</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.41</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.41

- The sidebar now reads Settings, Replace, Transcripts, with Onboarding at the bottom.
- Settings shows your version and Check for Updates at the top. The Advanced section is gone; each setting now sits with the section it belongs to.
- Shortcuts show as key caps with one Change button.
- Transcripts: search moved to the left, and Delete all moved into Settings.
- Onboarding has a new step that helps you find Say Halo in your menu bar.
- Added an Acknowledgements page in Settings.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.41/Say-Halo-0.8.41-build-134.zip" length="16075871" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qwB9mISvfF90fL7YoY7c1pStlR2XRgVytragMP4meyYw6BOPFy+ToCwpEKGmMYpCqxlqvu5ZQCIYaouwJKc7BA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.8.40</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:10:14 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>133</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.40</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.40

- The settings window is simpler. The four pages are now Settings, Transcripts, Replace and Onboarding.
- Settings shows everyday controls first. Fine-tuning is under Advanced.
- Transcripts has Today, 7 days, 30 days and All, plus search.
- Replace has search, sorting and examples for each formatting switch.
- Onboarding shows every step without opening anything. Once you finish, it becomes a short health check.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.40/Say-Halo-0.8.40-build-133.zip" length="16029587" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="spIusXptutXEwkK59fmwMQPi9peJhEk4HHZZ2n7Xeonvrcy3A9FV2o9Cm9Ccm3EOZHW/jls2pc8Rd+F+a468BQ=="/>
