        <item>
            <title>0.8.35</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:44:08 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>128</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.35</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.35

- With "Tap to toggle recording" on, every press of your shortcut key now starts or stops recording, however long you hold it. Before, a press held a little too long was ignored, so the next press started a silent recording.
- Holding the shortcut key no longer risks stopping and restarting a recording.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.35/Say-Halo-0.8.35-build-128.zip" length="15983761" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="mR/LqBJVxpuTJnGYIbkdHttxdlRpOFSiBxNFT9mkpsQfvhgGvRl8AFOu6MDjRVXSMV5mTWAPR2jZ2BV58w2SBw=="/>
