        <item>
            <title>0.8.34</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:07:55 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>127</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.34</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.34

- If a dictation comes back with no words, the menu bar now says "No speech heard" instead of doing nothing.
- If the microphone was silent, it says "Mic was silent. Check your input."
- Say Halo keeps the audio from your last 10 empty dictations on your Mac so problems can be diagnosed.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.34/Say-Halo-0.8.34-build-127.zip" length="15982110" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="1n3/TfrcKcYjIX8gFBlqfN094l7CfoCrICup+eSBhR2Uy3X76bm0A6oPiIe5iQHoGa5YsfFo7KNHChHhusI7DQ=="/>
